{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13112360","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13112360","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:4:1311236001:0":{"text":"Rodrigo... You've failed me.","source_cn":"……罗德里戈，你让我失望。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4C7CD2FDBF0CC0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1311236001":{"text":"Rodrigo... You've failed me.","source_cn":"……罗德里戈，你让我失望。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4C7CD2FDBF0CC0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311236002:0":{"text":"...Father! This isn't Rodrigo's fault! *Cough* Please don't blame him! It's all my fault!","source_cn":"……父亲！这不是罗德里戈的错！咳咳，都是我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45F445BEF3715A52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311236003:0":{"text":"Yolena, go back to your room. I need to have a serious talk with you later.","source_cn":"亚莲娜，你先回房间，等会我要好好和你聊聊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEE5A5256A7AB4DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311236004:0":{"text":"But...","source_cn":"可是，父亲……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA82D14818D9152B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311236005:0":{"text":"Go, now!","source_cn":"回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD0EA43CC0CBA8AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311236006:0":{"text":"Yes...","source_cn":"是……<key:dialog31>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AEA758473DF6DC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1311236007:0":{"text":"Rodrigo... Please tell Arteka that I can't give him the details of the festival anymore...","source_cn":"罗德里戈，你……你等等去画室告诉阿托卡，我没法告诉他祭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x309F078BFB1B5DFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1311236008:0":{"text":"Is the festival all you ever think about? Do you not care at all about your health?!","source_cn":"祭典、祭典……你总是想着出去玩，却丝毫不在意自己的健康...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDC93D9CF5381FE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1311236009:0":{"text":"Your Grace, please remain calm. If we pray sincerely, the Divine will surely bestow mercy upon Princess Yolena and restore her health.","source_cn":"大公阁下，请勿动怒。只要诚心祈祷，真神必会垂怜，还亚莲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EAEB4D500F38616","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1311236010:0":{"text":"I'm sorry, Father, please don't be mad!","source_cn":"对不起，父亲，你不要生气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43F91E0F363E5726","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1311236011:0":{"text":"Father, Your Excellency, I'll take my leave now...","source_cn":"父亲，大主教阁下，我先回去了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93D9883D6735F92B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1311236012:0":{"text":"Listen, Rodrigo, as the Princess' head guard, your primary duty is to ensure her safety. She is not to leave the castle without my permission, and no one is to visit her!","source_cn":"听着，罗德里戈，作为公主的侍卫长，你现在要做的就是保证...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28A715424710DC93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1311236013:0":{"text":"Ensure the doctor attends to the princess daily, and strictly monitor her routine and diet. This is your duty and your sole responsibility! Are we clear?!","source_cn":"每天按时监督医生为公主诊疗，严格照看她的起居饮食，这就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F0B3799727E0ED9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1311236013":{"text":"Ensure the doctor attends to the princess daily, and strictly monitor her routine and diet. This is your duty and your sole responsibility! Are we clear?!","source_cn":"每天按时监督医生为公主诊疗，严格照看她的起居饮食，这就是你的职责！也是你全部的职责！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F0B3799727E0ED9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1311236014:0":{"text":"She's still too young to see the reality and doesn't understand the price of fulfilling wishes, but you should.","source_cn":"她还太年轻，看不清现状，也不知道实现愿望需要付出什么代...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F3EAB0450C7DCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1311236015:0":{"text":"Her condition does not allow her to participate in the festival; even with a physician in attendance, it could still be dangerous. Thus, she must not leave the castle.","source_cn":"她的身体状况不允许她参加庆典，哪怕有医师贴身照料也很危...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF43A4C83DB027EBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1311236016:0":{"text":"I would rather be a strict father than risk my only daughter's life.","source_cn":"我宁愿当一个专断独行的父亲，只要能拯救我唯一的女儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8A969B83A5D6DEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1311236017:0":{"text":"